        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "3. In each chapter I have labeled propositions, theorems, and corollaries in a continuous manner (e.g., Proposition 3.6 is followed by Theorem 3.7, Corollary 3.8, etc.). Only the remarks and the lemmas are numbered separately."
          }
        ]
