        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "5. Many chapters are followed by numerous exercises. Partial solutions are pre-sented at the end of the book. More elaborate problems are proposed in a separate section called “Problems” followed by “Partial Solutions of the Problems.” The problems usually require knowledge of material coming from various chapters. I have indicated at the beginning of each problem which chapters are involved. Some exercises and problems expound results stated without details or without proofs in the body of the chapter."
          }
